    {"page": 3, "start": 9863, "end": 9903, "top": 673.8, "left": 324.0, "lastX": 511.2, "baseline": 684.19, "inkLeft": 324.12, "text": "how much space follows a paragraph, and "},
    {"page": 3, "start": 9903, "end": 9945, "top": 687.0, "left": 324.0, "lastX": 511.8, "baseline": 697.656, "inkLeft": 324.12, "text": "which words travel together across a page "},
    {"page": 3, "start": 9945, "end": 9989, "top": 700.8, "left": 324.0, "lastX": 525.0, "baseline": 711.096, "inkLeft": 324.12, "text": "boundary. A faithful reproduction must make "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 9989, "end": 10029, "top": 72.0, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 252.0, "baseline": 82.58, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "exactly the same decisions, because one "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 10029, "end": 10071, "top": 85.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 261.0, "baseline": 96.02, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "different break early in a document moves "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 10071, "end": 10121, "top": 99.0, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 277.8, "baseline": 109.46, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "every line that follows it onto a different page.\u000d"},
    {"page": 4, "start": 10121, "end": 10169, "top": 118.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 287.4, "baseline": 128.93, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "The quick survey of a quiet harbour town begins "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 10169, "end": 10217, "top": 131.4, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 280.8, "baseline": 142.37, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "at dawn, when the fishing boats drift back past "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 10217, "end": 10264, "top": 145.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 276.6, "baseline": 155.81, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "the lighthouse and the market stalls fold open "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 10264, "end": 10313, "top": 158.4, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 286.8, "baseline": 169.25, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "their striped awnings. Gulls wheel over the quay "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 10313, "end": 10356, "top": 172.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 267.0, "baseline": 182.69, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "while merchants argue cheerfully about the "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 10356, "end": 10400, "top": 185.4, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 266.4, "baseline": 196.13, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "price of mackerel, and a baker carries warm "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 10400, "end": 10445, "top": 198.6, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 266.4, "baseline": 209.35, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "loaves across the cobbles to the cafe on the "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 10445, "end": 10490, "top": 212.4, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 261.0, "baseline": 222.79, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "corner. By noon the visitors arrive, and the "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 10490, "end": 10536, "top": 225.6, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 264.6, "baseline": 236.23, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "narrow streets fill with the sound of voices, "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 10536, "end": 10569, "top": 238.8, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 209.4, "baseline": 249.67, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "bicycle bells and distant music.\u000d"},
    {"page": 4, "start": 10569, "end": 10619, "top": 258.6, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 285.6, "baseline": 269.11, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "In the workshop the lamps stay lit late. Shavings "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 10619, "end": 10671, "top": 271.8, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 286.8, "baseline": 282.58, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "gather under the bench, a kettle ticks as it cools, "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 10671, "end": 10725, "top": 285.6, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 286.8, "baseline": 296.02, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "and the half-finished chair waits for its last joint. "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 10725, "end": 10774, "top": 298.8, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 285.6, "baseline": 309.46, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "The maker steps back, squints along the rail and "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 10774, "end": 10818, "top": 312.6, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 263.4, "baseline": 322.9, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "decides that tomorrow will do for the glue.\u000d"},
    {"page": 4, "start": 10818, "end": 10866, "top": 331.8, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 287.4, "baseline": 342.34, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "The quick survey of a quiet harbour town begins "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 10866, "end": 10914, "top": 345.0, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 280.8, "baseline": 355.78, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "at dawn, when the fishing boats drift back past "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 10914, "end": 10961, "top": 358.8, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 276.6, "baseline": 369.24, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "the lighthouse and the market stalls fold open "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 10961, "end": 11010, "top": 372.0, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 286.8, "baseline": 382.68, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "their striped awnings. Gulls wheel over the quay "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 11010, "end": 11053, "top": 385.8, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 267.0, "baseline": 396.12, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "while merchants argue cheerfully about the "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 11053, "end": 11097, "top": 399.0, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 266.4, "baseline": 409.56, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "price of mackerel, and a baker carries warm "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 11097, "end": 11142, "top": 412.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 266.4, "baseline": 423.0, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "loaves across the cobbles to the cafe on the "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 11142, "end": 11187, "top": 426.0, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 261.0, "baseline": 436.44, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "corner. By noon the visitors arrive, and the "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 11187, "end": 11233, "top": 439.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 264.6, "baseline": 449.9, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "narrow streets fill with the sound of voices, "},
    {"page": 4, "start": 11233, "end": 11266, "top": 452.4, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 209.4, "baseline": 463.34, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "bicycle bells and distant music.\u000d"}
